{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The mouse is the controller!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a PC game, but don't use the keyboard at all, play only with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wheel the mouse as fast as you can and catch fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/fishing.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>128 species of fish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch piranhas, orcas, hippos, monkeys, and other fish beyond the norm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/fish.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's go shopping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the fish you catch and earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find items to move to new stages and equipment for sale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/shop.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your own equipment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you want the best fishing rod or a full set of special equipment, it's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even make your fishing rod so that it doesn't deplete your stamina, or so that it's more money-saving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/gear.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the rarest fish in each area, or catch 250 fish in a day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve various conditions and get gorgeous trophies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/trophy.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span>\u00a0cooperation\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span><br>Kobe Institute of Computing-College of Computing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seiji</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568200?t=1743461320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/d1b5856235c76303af689557932efb7b47f36045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743461320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/496f415e2787cd3d95966fba614cae675e2d08f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743461320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/496f415e2787cd3d95966fba614cae675e2d08f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743461320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The mouse is the controller!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a PC game, but don't use the keyboard at all, play only with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wheel the mouse as fast as you can and catch fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/fishing.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>128 species of fish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch piranhas, orcas, hippos, monkeys, and other fish beyond the norm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/fish.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's go shopping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the fish you catch and earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find items to move to new stages and equipment for sale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/shop.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your own equipment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you want the best fishing rod or a full set of special equipment, it's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even make your fishing rod so that it doesn't deplete your stamina, or so that it's more money-saving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/gear.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the rarest fish in each area, or catch 250 fish in a day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve various conditions and get gorgeous trophies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/extras/trophy.gif?t=1743461320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span>\u00a0cooperation\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span><br>Kobe Institute of Computing-College of Computing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seiji</p>","developers":["\u9b5a\u7fa4 ~GYOGUN~"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568200/3ad18799083df9a416ad1